ants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","review_id":"LLDgAZ3Y3Kf9WkxJ64JjQw","date":"2014-10-25T21:58:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411695003509521,"text_excerpt":"This is the second time I've been to this place. They have amazing brick oven pizzas. Lots of selections to choose from. Many are good Louisiana specialties. However I'm kinda plain so I just went with pepperoni. Had a great Caesar salad to go with it. It's located across from the farmers market in the French District. It's a nice little corner restaurant with windows open all around. They have some amazing olive oil on the table that's also available for purchase. Of course I had to get a bottle to take home. I looked forward to coming back here this year. We will definitely go again when we come back. They do have a good bar selection, wine and beer. They have some great looking dessert..."},{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","review_id":"hn2-qSjUJZg_LvdMsIEGUg","date":"2015-06-08T16:06:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9405642747879028,"text_excerpt":"I am so excited abou this place. My boyfriend took me here on a date and we ended up going back the next week. Its a tight and cozy, pizza kitchen. Immediately upon walking in you can see the wood master pizza chef and his whimsical wood oven. When seated, you're given an IPAD that includes the wine list, I enjoyed scrolling up and down as I tried to figure out exactly what I wanted. Most waiters may have been a little annoyed, but instead, our waiter let me try two different pairings that he believed I may enjoy. I settled for the D'Asti. I love a little bubbly...We ordered a pepperoni bacon pizza, all pizza comes in one standard size which was fine because we both ordered additional foo..."},{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","review_id":"0cbSUJ6vVqyToH0fIJWPVA","date":"2012-09-14T16:42:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9378136396408081,"text_excerpt":"YUM!!! We ordered a few different wood fired pizzas to share. We stopped in because we heard about how great the pizza was from our tour bus driver. It's close to the French Market and though it's awesome, when we were there, it wasn't too busy that we had to wait for a table or for our food for very long. Our server must have been new because she didn't have very good suggestions on local beer or the food or beverage menu. She still tried though and the pizza was good enough for me to give this place five stars. I'd definitely go back here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","photo_id":"wSb8hnGEKaOI2XbNV8nThg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/wSb8hnGEKaOI2XbNV8nThg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9055579900741577},{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","photo_id":"L9HKTK72pEoIOXjOawBTYA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/L9HKTK72pEoIOXjOawBTYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.894266664981842},{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","photo_id":"SKnvFT2NCvop_ZDsaLDpgw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/SKnvFT2NCvop_ZDsaLDpgw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8656390905380249},{"business_id":"lWPQeVAZInbNntRu6eFkbg","photo_id":"B3VK40kkp2RDBn8sNlSmcA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/B3VK40kkp2RDBn8sNlSmcA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0